<title>UK: Single Brent turning wet kept by Phibro - trade.</title>
<headline>Single Brent turning wet kept by Phibro - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The single Brent date nominated from the paper chains on Wednesday was kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline by trading company Phibro, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo loads August 7-9, they added. -- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
